    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesnt feel like a crisis though. a crisis implies things can go back to normal or get better. but there is no \"me\" left to fix. the person who had the career, the friends, the purpose... that person was real. now there is just this empty shell that people stare at with pity or hate. if the essence of who i am was tied to that life, and that life is gone, then what am i actually even for? it feels like the universe already finished with me.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
