    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing. there's no \"new version\" to find. it feels more like a finality. like when a file is permanently deleted, you don't get to just reconstruct it from nothing. i'm just a biological remainder of a person who doesn't exist anymore. it feels so much more logical to just... stop being here, rather than pretending this empty thing is still a person. it would be easier if things just matched reality.",
